## Bug Fixes Applied

| Issue | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| hashmap deinit leaked owned keys | Added `owned` field to kyHashEntry, free in deinit |
| hashmap deinit incorrectly freed stack values | Only free when `owned` flag is set |
| scene destroy double-free on meta values | Remove from hashmap first in resmgr destroy |
| physics.h redefined kySphere (dup in math.h) | Removed redundant typedef from physics.h |
| physics.c used pointer API for ky_vec3_sub/add | Fixed to pass values by copy |
| render test return code hardcoded to 7 | Changed to use failures counter |
| physics zero-gravity test | Reset velocity before asserting no change |

